# ==========================================
# Files git should NOT track
# ==========================================

# ---- JavaScript ----------------------------------------------------
# Downloaded libraries. Anyone cloning gets these back with `npm install`.
frontend/node_modules/
# The built website, regenerated by `npm run build`.
frontend/dist/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ---- Python --------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ---- Market data ---------------------------------------------------
# The CSV price files are DOWNLOADED data, not source code, so they are
# not tracked here. Get them with the US Stock Data Downloader project and
# drop them into any of these folders, then point the portal's Scan box at
# whichever one you want to test.
#
# There are several of these data sets on this machine:
#   data/         ~1 year of daily bars   (736 symbols,  10 MB)
#   data_5y/      ~5 years of daily bars  (753 files,    41 MB)
#   small_micro/  small & micro caps      (1637 files,   20 MB)
#
# Want to commit a data set anyway? Delete its line below.
*.csv
!frontend/**/*.csv

# ---- Editors / OS --------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---- Claude Code local settings ------------------------------------
.claude/settings.local.json
